        "Heading": "Study English with Lexis! - Lexis English",
        "Abstract": "Lexis English provides English language courses to international students who study in Australia. English courses include Cambridge PET, Cambridge FCE, Cambridge CAE, Cambridge CPE, IELTS Preparation, General English, High School English and recreational courses such as English and Surfing. Lexis has adult English programs, and English programs for junior students. Lexis English provides student visas for international students in Brisbane, Perth, Byron Bay, Noosa and the Sunshine Coast, in both cities and regional areas as defined for immigration purposes. Lexis English is CRICOS registered, and can issue students visas for study in Australia. Lexis provides credit pathways to top universities in Australia including Southern Cross University, Edith Cowan University, Torrens University, the University of Canberra, Griffith University, the University of Wollongong and the University of the Sunshine Coast. Lexis English can provide critical pathways for students looking to study in Australia, study vocational courses in Australia, study University courses in Australia, study High School in Australia, work in Australia and who are looking for Immigration to Australia. Lexis also offers homestay accommodation, student accommodation, apartments for students and residential student accommodation.",
